448
00:33:45.325 --> 00:33:47.060
What are you doing?

449
00:33:48.395 --> 00:33:49.463
I miss him.

450
00:33:53.400 --> 00:33:54.802
I miss him too.

451
00:33:55.970 --> 00:33:57.705
You know. when we were kids.

452
00:33:57.739 --> 00:34:00.140
Tessa was afraid to put
her hands in the cement.

453
